              "originalHeight": 945
            }
          },
          "body_html": "<p>Having explored both proven <strong>production architectures</strong> and emerging <strong>research frontiers</strong>, it is clear that <strong>optical networking</strong> is the definitive path forward for <strong>high density computing</strong>. However, deploying these advanced <strong>topologies</strong> across the global industry requires more than isolated breakthroughs.</p><p>It requires a unified <strong>supply chain</strong> and standardized, <strong>interoperable hardware</strong>.</p><p></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "text",
          "variant": "subheading",
          "style": {
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 0,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "heading_html": "<p><strong>By the end of this module, you will be able to:</strong></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "list",
          "variant": "bulleted",
          "style": {
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "list_style": "bulleted",
          "items_html": [
            "<p>Summarize the current state of OCS adoption across the networking industry.</p>",
            "<p>Identify the role of the Open Compute Project in advancing open standards and interoperability for OCS.</p>",
            "<p>Locate opportunities to participate and contribute within the broader OCS community.</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "quote",
          "variant": "d",
          "style": {
            "background_type": "LIGHT",
            "attached_to_next": false,
            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "quote_html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 2.1rem\"><em>We want to extend our recognition to </em><strong><em>Seema Mehta, CTO</em></strong><em> at </em><strong><em>Intel Labs</em></strong><em>. Her technical guidance was key during the design and development of these courses.</em></span></p>",
