            "padding_top": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 3,
            "marker_color_contrast": "AUTO"
          },
          "body_html": "<p>To effectively accelerate this transition, the <strong>optical networking ecosystem</strong> relies on robust collaboration across several distinct <strong>layers</strong> of the industry. Each layer is essential for integrating <strong>innovations</strong> and supporting the increasing demands for <strong>bandwidth</strong> and <strong>connectivity</strong>.</p><p>By cultivating these <strong>partnerships</strong> and maintaining open lines of communication among <strong>stakeholders</strong>, the optical networking ecosystem can rapidly respond to emerging challenges and seize new opportunities, thereby driving the advancement of innovative optical networking solutions.</p><p>Explore the layers of the ecosystem below to understand how each contributes to the advancement of open optical networking.</p>"
        },
