          "body_html": "<p>To achieve true <strong>scalability</strong> in <strong>hardware innovation</strong>, it is essential to adopt <strong>open standards</strong>.</p><p>The video below outlines the <strong>mission</strong> of the <strong>working group</strong> and provides your next steps for joining the <strong>community</strong>.</p>"
